<title>FINLAND: TALENTUM REJECTS AAMULEHTI, SANOMA CO-OP.</title>
<headline>TALENTUM REJECTS AAMULEHTI, SANOMA CO-OP.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish publisher Oy Talentum Ab said on Tuesday it had rejected cooperation offers from media groups Aamulehti and Sanoma Oy.</p>
<p>&quot;The company's board has decided that Talentum will not continue negotiations with either party,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
